node_modules/

# dist/ is NOT ignored, deliberately. estate installs this package straight from
# git — `"@mukco/ui-kit": "github:mukco/ui-kit#main"` — and npm runs no build step
# for a git dependency, so package.json's `main`/`types`/`exports` targets have to
# be committed or the install resolves to nothing. Run `npm run build` and commit
# dist/ alongside the src change.
